<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 2 points to 833.1 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 2 points to 833.1 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose two points on Tuesday to 833.1, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the ten sectoral indices gained, with the food index rising the most, up 11 points to 1,116.6.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
